# ClearPort Commit Message Convention
#
# Format: <type>: <description in plain language>
#
# Types:
#   fix:      bug fix
#   feat:     new feature
#   refactor: code restructuring (no behavior change)
#   docs:     documentation only
#   chore:    build, deps, config, tooling
#   test:     adding/updating tests
#   perf:     performance improvement
#
# The description must explain WHAT changed and WHY in plain language.
# No UUIDs, no generic placeholders.
#
# Examples:
#   fix: stop trusting client-supplied resolvedBy in update-exception audit trail
#   refactor: extract regex extraction logic from extract-document into lib/regex-extract.ts
#   chore: pin next/react to exact versions to prevent silent upgrades
#   test: add regression test for audit identity spoofing fix
#
